{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"5a9dbab1b9b14413236ec11bce11684a6c070d61128364d4209843b91e845265","ja":"海での遊び","zh":"海边游玩","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"82672f344bf08b6d4309d2882306b871c82318462bedbcd04400b1853ae8bce6","ja":"ふう……。潮風がとても心地よいですね。\nこうして海を眺めていると、気持ちが安らぎます。","zh":"呼……海风吹得真舒服啊。\n像这样眺望大海，心情也会平静下来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9c6ff39b0517d32df3f3f5e3fc29beade15f83c499cdc624db0c231ede1bca38","ja":"南の海じゃないのが、ちょ～っと残念ですけどね～。\n本当は、全国ツアーの時に海に行きたかったな～。","zh":"遗憾的是，这里不是南方的海呢～。\n其实我本来很想在全国巡演的时候去海边的～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"72a26720aa734e8f4784959f41297d159a7bc95c7cb8366bff7c562613b75bbc","ja":"こればかりは仕方ありません。ツアーでは、\nなにかとバタバタしていましたし……。","zh":"这实在是没办法。巡演期间，也一直忙忙碌碌的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0185d5936d2334df49171303599121b3812df96d3a7e8f0992ba3a5fe94a3b6c","ja":"近場ではありますが、こうして今日\n4人で海に来れただけでも良しとしましょう。","zh":"虽然离得不远，但今天能这样和4个人一起来海边，也算不错了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f57a8e6fbe9586dee887ca41b0e7dec057430440564427c8effec7728928b184","ja":"そうですね♪　せっかくなんだし、\nみんなで思いっきり楽しんじゃいましょう～♪　","zh":"是啊♪难得有这样的机会，大家一起尽情享受吧～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"be1d05c0e05feab0a5db9163bdf41622c1c4428f755eae28325a6273c8c9b73b","ja":"そういえば恵美ちゃん、今日のためになにか\n用意してたみたいだけど……何を持ってきたのです？","zh":"说起来，惠美好像为今天准备了什么……带来了什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"922ddb4d54cdb9e23a1f6f9e40aa35e505e669bce7e18953e6aa9ea331cfd1f9","ja":"あ、そうそう！　ほら、せっかく海に来るんだしさ、\nちょっとした遊び道具をね！　……じゃーん！","zh":"啊，对了对了！难得来到海边嘛，就带了点小玩意儿来玩！……锵锵！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c0e9d76a1fc405c3ef65e326cf73e0c6303e4a51afe1b681c3e0a9bafe702f62","ja":"バレーボール！　ということは、\nビーチバレーをするのですね？","zh":"排球！也就是说，要打沙滩排球吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b581af60741a4671f0499d575fc942cf182c350c070cc0c7dde720462e655b10","ja":"そうそう！　やっぱり、海でみんなで\n遊べるものって言ったら、これかなって思ったんだ！","zh":"对对！说到能让大家在海边一起玩的东西，我果然还是觉得这个最合适！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_903.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4067626b151db54ee421cd83d0558ba2a9e2f706a0cda9d7b359751008fd0f5e","ja":"ナイスアイデアなのです、恵美ちゃん！\nそれじゃあ早速、チーム分けをするのですよ！","zh":"真是个好主意，惠美！\n那么，我们马上来分组吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
